  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaBirthtime.CriesLegsSpreading": "[pg][say: I-I don't know!] Hel cries, leaning back against you, her legs spreading. [say: I don't </i>fucking<i> know! Just--aahhhh--hold my hand!]"
