  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaBirthtime.HelWaddlesPregnant": "The morning dawns like any other, though as you're getting dressed, you can't help but notice Hel waddling back from the edge of camp, both hands firmly gripping her positively massive belly. You walk over just in time to hear her groan, [say: Oh fuck me sideways and call me a harpy, this shit sucks.] You put an arm around her to steady the sickened salamander, but she barely notices you as she flops down beside her still, nearly grabbing a glass before stopping herself. [say: Fucking shit fuck I am so done with this. I-- oh god,] she doubles over, squeezing her belly. [say: Ow ow oh god ow.]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaBirthtime.HerWord": "her "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaBirthtime.KneelsAsksWhatNeeded": "[pg]Kneeling beside the salamander, you ask what she needs--what can you do?"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaBirthtime.ScreamsGrippingHand": "child. Hel screams and cries, gripping your hand so tight you feel like your bones are about to break in her iron gasp; you try and tell her to push, to remember everything the Midwives of Ingnam would say when a village girl gave birth. It seems a small comfort to the screaming salamander, but she does as you say, pushing harder and harder until you can see the crown of a little baby's head pushing out of your lover's well-stretched cunt. Suddenly with a roar that echoes across the wasteland and a mighty push, a squalling baby tumbles out of Hel's birth canal and into your waiting arms."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaBirthtime.YourWord": "your "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaBonusPointsAward.CentaursAndFoxPricks": ", and centaurs, and those two fox pricks at the bar filling both my holes, and I love beer and fighting and ramming my tail up peoples' assholes. But that's not real love, right? Love is-- oh, god, I'm making a mess of this. Again. I keep doing this; it always works out so much better in my head.[sayend]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaBonusPointsAward.ChestThenVagina": " and your [chest] and your [vagina]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaBonusPointsAward.ConfessionStammering": "[pg][saystart]I don't just like you, [name]--I mean, I do. Like you, I mean. But it's... it's more than that, you know? Sure, I've said the word, but I say 'love' to a lot of people, a lot of things. I love your "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaBonusPointsAward.EverythingElseDenial": " and everything else about you. But... but that doesn't mean anything. It doesn't. "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaBonusPointsAward.EyebrowCockedQuestion": "You cock an eyebrow, saying that you're already alone, but she shakes her head, saying she needs somewhere private, away from prying eyes. "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaBonusPointsAward.NodAssentFollowHer": "You nod your assent, and let her help you up and lead you away from camp. You follow Hel through the darkness, stumbling after her until you're hidden away beneath the old ruined wall a stone's throw from the perimeter. Safely tucked away beneath the shadow of the wall, Hel takes your hands in hers and hesitantly, says, [say: Look, I don't... this isn't easy for me, okay? But I have to tell you something, [name]. And it's important, alright? To me, anyway. I wouldn't bring it up if I could deal with it myself, honest. But I can't and... and I'm afraid, [name].]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaBonusPointsAward.NodRubbingSleep": "[pg]You nod, rubbing the sleep out of your eyes as you stagger up onto your [feet]. You note that Hel's wrapped her old cloak tightly around herself, held closed so that nothing but her face is visible. You start to ask what's up, but Hel shushes you, saying she needs to talk to you privately. "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaBonusPointsAward.NotWhatIWanted": "[pg][say: That's not what I wanted to tell you, though. I'd have sat on that for years if I could have, but something's changed. I've talked to my father, and he says it's normal. He just... just chuckled and shook his head, gave me this knowing look. But I'm still afraid, [name]. I can't deal with this on my own, but... but I have to know, before we go any further: do you love me, too? And please, please don't just say yes because it's what I want to hear. I promise I won't run off or throw a tantrum if you say no; I liked where we were before I opened my big stupid mouth. So, what do you say, [name]? Do you love me?]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaBonusPointsAward.PastMinotaurDickClaim": "I've said in the past that I love minotaur dicks"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaBonusPointsAward.RealLoveNotFake": "[pg][say: I guess what I'm trying to say is... I love you, [name]. I really, really do. Not fake, shitty, stupid love; not me saying it in the heat of the moment. I've been thinking about this for a while, now. You've been so good to me [name], better than I deserve. You saved my family, you've given me a place to live, and more kindness than I could ever have imagined when I jumped you in the plains so very long ago.]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaBonusPointsAward.SayLoveMinotaurDicks": "I say I love minotaur dicks"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaBonusPointsAward.SinceYouHelpedNeeds": "[pg][say: Hell, ever since you said you'd take care of my, you know, needs, I... I haven't actually been with anyone else other than you, I didn't even <i>want</i> to be with anyone else.]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaBonusPointsAward.SleepTuggedAwake": "Your sleep is disturbed by a gentle tugging on your [armor]. You groggily swat at whatever's nudging at you, groaning about the hour until your eyes finally open wide enough to recognize Helia kneeling over you, a deeply distraught look in her eyes. [say: [name]? [name] wake up, I need to talk to you. Please?]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaBonusPointsAward.SqueezeHandsReassure": "[pg]You squeeze Helia's hands and reassure her as best you can, saying she can tell you anything. She looks away, blushing hotly; beneath her cloak, the radiant fire of her long tail shines brighter, casting a pale glow even through the heavy fabric. You ask again what's wrong, and with a little coaxing, Hel looks up, her bright crimson eyes staring into yours."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaBonusPointsAward.ThatNightBoldHeader": "[pg]<b>That night...</b>[pg]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaBonusPointsAward.VaginaThenChest": " [vagina] and [chest]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaGravidity.AsksAboutChildName": "[pg]After a minute, she looks up at you and asks, [say: So, have you thought about a name?]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaGravidity.AsksMotherName": "[pg]Gently, you ask what her mother's name was."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaGravidity.FeelsFuckingUseless": "[pg][say: Thanks, [name]. God, I feel so fucking useless lately... you know, a shitty little goblin jumped me the other day, and I actually pussied out and waddled the fuck home. Ugh. I can't drink, I can't get laid half the time, and whenever I get a chance to fight I get freaked out the baby might get hurt and run home with my tail between my legs. I am so ready for this to be over,] she groans, awkwardly sitting down with both hands wrapped over her gut. You put an arm around her shoulders, pulling Helia close; she smiles prettily and rests her head on your chest, sighing heavily."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaGravidity.GreetsSweetheart": "[pg][say: Hey, sweetheart,] Hel says as you wander over, planting a kiss on her cheek. [say: So, it won't be long now, I don't think. I hope. If I get any bigger I'm liable to burst.]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaGravidity.HelSlowGettingAround": "You can't help but notice that Hel's starting to have a hard time getting around, lately--and she's been sticking closer and closer to camp, barely leaving at all the last few days. Now, she's fussing around her part of camp, trying to beat some spare logs into a crib one-handed. You can't remember the last time you saw her walking around without a hand on her back to support her gravid belly, the other absently rubbing or poking at it, already playing with the child inside her."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaGravidity.HelStaresIntoDistance": "[pg]You give her a moment, but Hel seems to be done talking for now, instead staring off into the distance. You leave her with a kiss, and get back to your duties."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaGravidity.HmQuestion": "[pg][say: Hm?]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaGravidity.HoldsBeamsForHel": "[pg]You chuckle to yourself and hold the wood beams still for Hel, helping her to fit the last few pieces together."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaGravidity.MotherNamedTanis": "[pg][say: Oh, I never told you? Her name was Tanis, and she was the most beautiful woman in the world.]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaGravidity.ThinkingAboutNames": "[pg][say: A name. For the kid. I've been thinking pretty hard about it, the last few days. What do you think about Kyros or Hylas for boy names? They were brothers in this ancient legend mom used to tell me, a pair of salamander master smiths who sought out the great dragon Perethal and stole from his horde the first steel the world had ever seen, and forged it into a magic sword. It was so beautiful, the legend went, that Marae herself took it for her own, gave it to the greatest of her champions for generations: once even a descendant of the smiths. And if we have a girl... I don't really know, yet. Maybe Syn or Chara. Dad says I should name her after mother, but that doesn't sit right with me. Dunno why, but I just don't want a ghost's name on my living girl, you know?]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaLoveFollowup.EvenAnotherWomanSeems": "even another woman, it seems, "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaLoveFollowup.FillMeWithSeed": "You'll fuck me full of kids, right? Please? Give me your seed, [name]. Give it all to me until I'm fucking gravid with your salamander babies."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaLoveFollowup.GrowDickSuggestion": "Even if you can't fuck me full of babies... you could grow a dick! There's plenty of things in this god-forsaken world that do that. O-or if you don't want to, I bet I can get one of the fox-girls, or a minotaur, or something. You know I can find a dick somewhere, just say the word."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaLoveFollowup.LetsHaveAKid": " So what do you say, [name]? Let's have a kid![sayend]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaLoveFollowup.LoveChildNotMe": "Even if you don't love me, you'd love our child, right? You can fuck me full of kids, or even... even get someone else to, I don't care. I just </i>need<i> it, [name]. More than anything else in the whole wide world."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaLoveFollowup.LoveYouSoMuch": "I love you, [name]. I love you so much. I want to share this with you. "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaLoveFollowup.NotFromHereInfertile": "You're not from here, so you probably don't know much about salamanders. Basically, we're effectively infertile. I can get filled with gallons of cum day in and day out, and chances are none of it will take inside me. I've always thought I could slut around as much as I wanted, and I'd never have to worry about the consequences. But... that's not forever, I guess. When a salamander girl finds the person she wants to be with forever, "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaLoveFollowup.TooBigShrinkHint": " <b>Unfortunately, you're too big to squeeze inside Helia to do the business yourself. You might need to shrink down some.</b>"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaLoveFollowup.UndoCloakClasp": "[pg]Hel reaches up and undoes the clasp on her cloak. When it falls away, your eyes are drawn immediately to her tail--once burning with a blood-red hellfire, her leathery tail is now surrounded by a pale radiance, shimmering like white gold. Your eyes widen, but Hel flinches back as you try to approach. [saystart]It's called the Pale Flame, [name]. Just like it looks. When a 'mander girl finds the person she wants to be with, our bodies change. While I'm like this... I'm as fertile as a goblin, and... and I </i>want<i> to be. I want... I need... a child, [name]. I want to be pumped full of cum until I'm bloated, to bear a little salamander for us to raise and love. "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaLoveFollowup.WeChangeEllipsis": "we... change.[sayend]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaSwollenNotice.AsksSheGrinning": "[pg][say: She?] you ask, grinning."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaSwollenNotice.BellyKickingNow": "[pg][say: Come feel, [name], quick! It's kicking!]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaSwollenNotice.EarToBelly": "[pg]You trot over and press your ear to Hel's big belly, running your hands along her taut skin. A moment later, and you feel a little push against you, a tiny kick right to the head from the little salamander inside your lover."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaSwollenNotice.HelWandersClutchingBelly": "You note that Hel's wandering aimlessly around camp, one hand over her belly as she mumbles to herself. You could swear she was cursing her now quite swollen belly, but suddenly she gives a girlishly happy cry and waves you over."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaSwollenNotice.HelpsHerSitDown": "[pg][say: Feels like she's gonna kick her way out of there sometimes,] Hel says, chuckling. You help her sit down, both of you running your hands along the surface of her belly, responding to the little pushes her child's making. [say: She's going to be a fighter, [name], let me tell you.]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaSwollenNotice.WhichDoYouWant": "[pg][say: Or he. Whichever... so, which do you want, lover mine? A big strong boy, or a fiery little girl just like her mom?]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaTalkEight.AgreeGirlLooksOlder": "[pg]Hel's right. Your little girl looks like she's five, maybe six years old already."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaTalkEight.HelLeansOnShoulder": "[pg]Sighing, Hel leans her head on your shoulder, wrapping her tail around your waist. [say: Well, I guess we get even less time to learn how to be parents, huh? I guess it doesn't matter how it happened--what matters is that our little girl's going to be a big girl damn soon. Let's enjoy it while we can, eh?]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaTalkEight.MentionAmilyPotion": "[pg]You mention how Amily managed to reverse-engineer a goblin's potion to accelerate her children's growth. Hel grimaces, running a hand over her belly. [say: God damn green menaces. I never--almost never--drank any of their shit. Succubus milk? Sure, why not. Snake oil, bring it on... But goblin potions? I'm not that stupid, [name]. It couldn't have been...]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaTalkEight.NodAndPlayTogether": "[pg]You nod to your lover, and the both of you walk over to spend some quality time playing with [helspawn]."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaTalkEight.NodAtGrowthRemark": "[pg][say: She's growing up so fast... and only getting faster. By the time I pulled her off my breast the first time, I swear she'd doubled in size.] You nod, able to see it clearly yourself. Your little girl's growing fast... and it's not just a parental pride, either. She really is growing up faster, many times faster than a human girl. And, by the sound of things, many times faster than a salamander ought to. You ask Hel if that's right, and she nods gravely."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaTalkEight.SelfBlameWorldTaint": "[pg][say: I don't know what it is about this world, but it's touched me... my daughter... already. She's growing like a little goblin, and I don't know why. Could it have been something I drank? Something I fucked? I can't... I don't know, [name]. It's probably my fault, but I can't imagine what I did wrong. She should be taking years to get this big, but look at her...]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaTalkEight.WatchDaughterTogether": "Watching your little daughter crawl around, you and Hel sit down together arm in arm, smiling as the little salamander girl plays with bits and pieces of Hel's gear."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaTalkSeven.AsksAboutLayingEggs": "[pg]Still caressing the swell of Hel's stomach, you mention that you'd have expected a salamander to lay an egg--even if she's only carrying a half-salamander. Hel's chuckles, [say: Salamanders ditched the whole egg thing ages ago, I guess. I mean, we're scaly lizard folk and all, but come on--these aren't just for show, you know,] she says, cupping her hefty tits, which seem to have grown just a touch larger since she conceived."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaTalkSeven.HopeHeTakesAfter": ", even if he's not your get, I can hope, you know? If he spends enough time around you, maybe he'll take more after you than me"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaTalkSeven.SecludedSpotWithHel": "You take Hel with you to a secluded spot at the edge of camp and sit with her, asking how she's doing as you run a hand across her pregnant belly. She nuzzles against you, wrapping her lengthy tail around your waist as her cheek nestles into the nape of your neck. [say: It's... not like I expected, [name]. Whenever I used to think of being a mother, I always sort of skipped the whole 'carry the little bastards around in your belly' part. I just feel so... full, I guess? Like I just ate a horse, and the horse is inviting its friends to come party at night whenever I try to sleep. Heh, this little firebrand just loves to kick and squirm at night, let me tell you. Speaking of which--] Hel takes your hand in hers and places it over her belly, letting you feel the subtle little movements inside her as your growing child pushes out toward the world."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaTalkSeven.SentencePeriodSayEnd": ".[sayend]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaTalkSeven.SwellWithMilk": "[pg][say: Getting ready to swell with milk,] Hel says, proudly patting her bust. [say: Don't worry, lover mine; we salamanders are hard drinkers right out of the womb, but I'll be sure to save plenty for you!]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliaTalkSeven.ThanksForCheckingIn": "[pg]A moment of laughing passes before Hel adds, [saystart]But seriously, lover, thanks for checking in on me. I don't... I can't do this on my own, you know? I'm trying, but it's hard, and getting harder. Every night since this started, I've lain up thinking 'Oh god, what if I screw this up? Wh-what if I say something wrong, or do something that just twists my kid's mind and fucks her up forever? Or she turns into a bigger whore than I am,' or a million other things I can't stop thinking about. I just keep worrying that I'm going to be a shit mom. But you know... with you around, I feel at least a little more confident. I don't know if I even could have a good impression on our kid, but... I know you will, [name]. You're a strong [manboy]; stronger than I'll ever be. I just hope a tiny little sliver of your strength--and maybe a healthy dose of your looks--rub off on him. Or her. That's all I'd ask for"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliasAppearanceScreen.AssholeCockDraining": "[pg]Hel has a single cock-draining asshole between her buttcheeks, right where it belongs."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliasAppearanceScreen.AuraPleasantHeat": " that lets off a pleasant heat, though it never seems to burn you. Hel is wearing her scale bikini and a leather thong, and using her scimitar as a weapon"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliasAppearanceScreen.BellyGravidFull": " Hel's belly is positively gravid, full of a little salamander child."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliasAppearanceScreen.BellySwellingChild": " Hel's belly is starting to look fairly bloated, swelling with her child."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliasAppearanceScreen.BigSoftBreasts": "[pg]Hel has a pair of big, soft E-cup breasts, each with a [if (metric) {1.2 centimeter|0.5 inch}] nipple at their tip."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliasAppearanceScreen.BlueBandanaWrapped": "; she's got her blue bandana wrapped around her head, mostly obscured by her fiery hair"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliasAppearanceScreen.GlowBrightOrange": "bright orange glow"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliasAppearanceScreen.GlowBrightWhite": "bright white glow"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliasAppearanceScreen.HelSalamanderHeight": "Hel the salamander stands seven feet tall, with pale skin and thick, bright-red scales covering her arms and legs, though she has a normal human torso and face. A fiery tail swishes gaily behind her, blazing with a "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliasAppearanceScreen.HumanFaceDetails": ". She has a human face, with bright red eyes, gentle, feminine features and a smattering of pale scales on her cheeks, like freckles. Hel has long, bright-red hair bound in a pony-tail that hangs down her back. She has wide-flared hips and a soft, squishy butt. Her two reptilian legs are visibly adorned with scales and claws, ending in soft, leathery soles."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliasAppearanceScreen.PregnancyEarlyBulge": " Hel's just starting to show a little bulge of pregnancy."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliasAppearanceScreen.TailWhiteHotHeat": " Hel's long, reptilian tail is currently burning white-hot, signaling her body's ready for motherhood."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliasAppearanceScreen.ThighScarsTrio": " A dark trio of scars run down Hel's thighs, left by [helspawn]'s youthful claws."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HeliasAppearanceScreen.WarmWetPussy": "[pg]She has a warm, wet, and accommodating pussy between her legs."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelsLifestyle.FingerToYourLips": "[pg]You start to answer, but Hel puts a finger to your lips, telling you she needs a little while to think. You nod, and head back to your work."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelsLifestyle.HopeYouLoveHer": "and I hope that's part of why you love me"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelsLifestyle.KnowsWhyNotLoved": "even though I know that's probably part of why you can't love me back"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelsLifestyle.SeriousAboutRubbingOff": "Being very serious for a moment, you tell Hel that if she's worried about her terrible choices rubbing off on her kid, maybe she ought to reconsider some of the things she's done: be less of a slut, drink less, be less of a bloodthirsty maniac in battle. Slowly, Hel nods to the rhythm of your words. [saystart]Yeah, maybe... maybe I should. I don't know if I can change though, [name]. I'm not as young as I was--or at least, I don't feel it--and I've been living the way I have been for years. I don't know if I could just give up the shit I do: the partying and the drinking, the fighting and the fucking. It's part of who I am, "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelsLifestyle.WantsYouRaiseChild": ". I'll try and rein it in, but maybe... it'd be better if you were the one who raised my child, [name]. God knows I'm the least qualified person to do it.[sayend]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnAllGrownUp.FollowerAddedNotice": "[pg]<b>([Helspawn] has been added to the Followers menu!)</b>"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnAllGrownUp.MorningGlanceHelspawn": "You wake up the next morning, and soon find your eyes drawn to where [helspawn] lies, barely an arm's reach from her mother's hammock, still snoring peacefully. You sigh wistfully as you get up and get dressed, still thinking of the night before and your girl's little misadventure with the spider. God, she's grown up fast. Faster than you could have imagined--or her mother, for that matter. Helia, too, is still reeling from her daughter's rapid, mutagenic growth. But there's nothing to be done about that, now, and it seems she's reached what passes for adulthood in this strange world. She's had the body of a woman for some time now, and it seems the mind and desires of one as well."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnAllGrownUp.SadGrownUp": "[pg]A part of you is sad to see her all grown up, and now you know it's time to treat your daughter like a woman. The time to raise her, to shape her development, is over. You can only hope you've done a good enough job to keep her safe in this hellish world; to give her sound judgment and the abilities she'll need to protect herself in the years and adventures to come."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnBathe.AdultSoonChat": "[pg]She'll be an adult before you know it, surely. Passing the time as [helspawn] eats, you quietly chat with your lover. The conversation moves onto your memories of the parents and children back in Ingnam. In time, the child dozes off, and you feel it's best to let her have some silence. You leave her in Helia's arm, snoozing away as you resume your [day]."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnBathe.BathTripStream": "[pg]That she does, as any growing child would. With Helia coming along, the three of you waltz to the stream, settling in a shallow spot. The adoring mother sits at the shore, soaking her legs only, as you [walk] further in with [helspawn] in your arms. Your daughter jolts on contact with the water, surprised at first, but the comforting embrace of her [father] helps her to realize there's no danger here. In moments, she's kicking and splashing with glee."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnBathe.FeedJokeDarkens": "[pg]Helia giggles at you. [say: With her constant hunger, you'd swear I don't even feed her.] Her expression dips to a half-smile. [say: She's a growing girl.]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnBathe.HeliaSuggestsBath": "[pg]Helia comes up from behind you, embracing you as well. [say: She needs a bath, [name].]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnBathe.HungryBellyGrowl": "[pg]An audible growl catches your attention, rumbling from the little one's belly. Your daughter whines, [say: Mommy!] and begs for a teat to suckle."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnBathe.LiftScaledDaughter": "You take your {0}-scaled daughter in your arms, squeezing her with careful adoration. Laughing, the little salamander yells, [say: [Daddy]!]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnBathe.NippleFeedingRemark": "[pg]Giggling, Helia takes her daughter and slips a nipple in her mouth immediately. [say: With her constant hunger, you'd swear I don't even feed her.] Her expression dips to a half-smile. [say: She's a growing girl.]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnBathe.ScrubScalesShine": "[pg]You spend some time scrubbing the small, undeveloped girl's body, bringing those scales to a shine. Helia remarks, [say: She really takes to the water faster than I ever could.]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnBathe.SplashAppetiteArmor": "[pg]All the kicking and splashing worked up an appetite. [if (hasarmor){{{0}}}] You pull the tiny salamander to your bosom, and she immediately begins feeding. [helspawn] sighs and looks to be in a state of bliss. Seeing as she's sufficiently clean, you [walk] to the shore and sit beside her other mother."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnBathe.SquishHungryCheeks": "[pg]Sighing, you squish the hungry girl's face and scrub her cheeks one last time before [walking] to her mother to hand her off."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnBathe.TossWashRag": "[pg]With the child accustomed to the water, Helia decides it's time for the proper wash and tosses a rag to you. [say: Don't forget to get behind her ears!] she yells, smiling brightly at seeing you in your paternal role."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnCampfire.FoodDoneConsoleHer": "[pg]When the food is done, you eagerly dig in, though only after consoling [helspawn] when she takes an overeager bite of her still scalding-hot fish. The skewers are soon stripped clean, but the night isn't over yet, so you three continue talking by the fire, your daughter not contributing much but clearly enjoying all of the attention you're giving her."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnCampfire.LateSleepyEyes": "It's getting late, and [helspawn] is already starting to rub her eyes, so you don't want to do anything too strenuous. Instead, you think that a nice campfire bonding session would be the best way to spend time with your daughter."
