  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnFishing.WillingToTeach": "[pg]Well that's okay, you would be more than happy to show her. You put the pole in her grip before getting up and moving around behind her. Like this, you're able to direct your daughter, guiding her through a few practice motions. The cast is the most important part, so you spend several minutes helping her get it just right."
