  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnSparPrank.LeadsTheCharge": "[pg]This time she leads the charge, visibly preparing for a grapple. You dash left, and she leaps toward you, but her once-more elongated tail swings her momentum into an outright spin. The poor warrior twirls like a drunken ballerina, at the mercy of the torque her [if (metric) {3-and-a-half meter |12-foot-}]long appendage causes. Dizzy and dazed, [helspawn] rubs her head and glares at you. There's no hiding that shenanigans are at play now."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnSparPrank.PlayAlongWithGhost": "Playing along with the {0}ghost, you explain to [helspawn] that you can teach her a lot more about combat than Helia could. After all, Helia is an unhinged berserker, wild and exploitable, while you understand battle tactics to a more nuanced degree."
