  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnSparPrank.ReciprocateFirstMove": "[pg]You reciprocate, and go in for the first move in much the fashion Helia might, intent on tripping up [helspawn] by performing what she would assess as a flurry, but is merely a feint. Shouldra, on the other hand, has her own plans. While [helspawn] is distracted by your approach, the distant sense of spell-casting accompanies the visual morphing of her tail. You take notice and press the attack instead. As your daughter makes for a dodge, her now elongated tail shifts her balance far from expected, and she falls over completely."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnSparPrank.ScramblesExaminesSelf": "[pg]Disoriented, the salamander scrambles to her feet, examining herself to see what trickery is at play, yet her tail has already returned to normal. [say: A-again!] she commands, flustered by her mistake."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnSparPrank.UnfairMessingAccusation": "[pg][say: [Dad]! This is unfair, you're messing with me big-time!] she accuses. You consider how to explain the prank, but a headache strikes you instead."
