  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnSparPrank2.FightingWindsDown": "[pg]The fighting finally winds down, and, being so-often curious of your thoughts, Shouldra remarks on your surprise. [say: It was a good laugh for me, Champ, but I saw the chance to do some parenting and I took it.]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnSparPrank2.InstinctsEmbrace": "[pg]Your [paternal] instincts take over, causing you to embrace her without a second thought. You return the sentiment, just as she returns the hug. In the back of your mind, an adoring [say: aww] can be heard."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnSparPrank2.PrankBecomesTraining": "To your surprise, what started as a prank ends up being nearly an hour of combat exercises centered around teaching [helspawn] to adapt to disorienting effects. Whatever may alter her center of balance, such as if she were on shaky ground or the deck of a boat, or alter her sense of equilibrium, such as a blow to the head or the effects of drugs, she'll have a much stronger grasp of it thanks to the spell-work of Shouldra."
