  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnSurpriseEnd.ContentLoveSigh": "[pg][say: I love you, [Daddy].] A content sigh slips out of her as you run your fingers through her sweaty, messy hair, her [helspawneyes] eyes shining brilliantly as she glances into yours. [say: How was it?] she finally stumbles out[if (!helspawnchaste) {, and that's about the last thing you ever thought you'd hear from her}]."
