  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnsMainMenu.ArmsAroundHug": "throwing her arms around you and hugging you tightly"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnsMainMenu.CallHelspawnOver": "You call [helspawn] over to you and she comes running, "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnsMainMenu.LiftAndClutchTight": "grabbing you off your [feet] and clutching you in a tight hug"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnsMainMenu.RuffleHairAskMinute": ". Laughing despite yourself, you ruffle her fiery hair and ask her if she's got a minute."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HelspawnsMainMenu.SureWhatsUpReply": "[pg][say: Sure, {0}! What's up?]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HugHelspawn.GrabAndHug": "You grab [helspawn] and pull her into a tight hug. She lets out a girlish giggle as she falls into your arms and squeezes you right back. Her powerful arms threaten to crush your bigger body, smothering you in affection. Her tail slips around your [leg], the warm leather binding you to your beloved daughter as she nuzzles into your [chest]."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HugHelspawn.LoveKissCheek": "[pg][say: Love you too, {0},] she laughs, planting a quick kiss on your cheek before letting you go."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HugHelspawn.LoveKissCheekAgain": "[pg][say: Love you too, {0},] she laughs, planting a quick kiss on your cheek before letting you go."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.HugHelspawn.PullDownHug": "You reach up and pull [helspawn] down to your level, wrapping your arms tight around her slender shoulders. Grinning from ear to ear, the towering girl squeezes you right back, her powerful muscles just about crushing your smaller body. Her tail slips around your [hips], the warm leather binding you to your beloved daughter as she nuzzles up against you."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.IncestWithHelspawn.ConveyLoveTension": "[pg]Conveying your love to her, you feel the sexual tension welling up in you, but the giddy, flushed salamander hops to her feet and wanders off, possibly too overwhelmed by this development to sit still any longer. You'll be able to find her easily enough, when you wish to."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.IncestWithHelspawn.CupHerCheek": "You cup [helspawn]'s cheek, turning her to you. The one that knows best how to guide her is you, her [father]. [if (chastespawn) {A deep blush colors her face. [if (!helspawnvirgin) {[say: I-I guess you're right...]|[say:B-but you're my... [dad].]}] She looks away and wags her tail nervously. The love of a [father] for [his] daughter is profound, and when she's had more time to learn about the world and sex, she'll be better suited to navigate the dangers out there, while in the here and now she can explore it all at her pace, in safety. [Helspawn] gazes up at the sky. [say: At heart, I'm really a... [daddy]'s girl,] she says as she turns and kisses you on the lips.|A blush covers her face, and soon a sultry gaze. [if (!helspawnvirgin) {[say: [Daddy] knows best.]|[say: I didn't know that was an option.]}] Taken by the moment, your daughter pushes herself upon you and entwines her tongue with your own. The warmth of her body seems more intense somehow as she embraces you further. Soon, all of her limbs are wrapped around you, and she pulls her lips away to speak. [say: Let's make [if (isfeminine) {my other }]mom jealous with how much of a [daddy]'s girl I am for you...] A short giggle escapes her before she kisses you again. [say: I'm lucky to have someone like you to raise me... and to love me. I love you, [daddy].]}]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.IncestWithHelspawn.MovedToLoversMenu": "[pg][b:([Helspawn] has been moved to the Lovers menu!)]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.LoseSparringToDaughter.AsYouStumbleBack": "As you stumble back, "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.LoseSparringToDaughter.AsksWentEasy": "[pg][say: You didn't go easy on me, did you?] she asks as you regain your balance. When you shake your head, she beams, smiling from ear to ear. Prancing out of reach, she breaks down into a happy little dance, gloating over her victory over the mighty Champion. You shake your head and ruffle her hair, reminding her not to get too full of herself."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.LoseSparringToDaughter.BothBreakSnickering": "[pg]She can barely finish the sentence before you both break out snickering. She gives you a rough punch on the shoulder and rolls off, flopping onto her back beside you. [say: That was fun, {0}. Thanks for spending a little time with me. No hard feelings?]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.LoseSparringToDaughter.CatchesYourArm": ", [helspawn] grabs your arm, catching you before you can fall. [say: Easy there, {0}, I got you,] she says, pulling you into a quick hug."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.LoseSparringToDaughter.DunkYourHead": "dunk your head"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.LoseSparringToDaughter.GrinsAndKissesCheek": "[pg][say: I wouldn't dream of it, {0}!] she grins, planting a quick kiss on your cheek before you head off to "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.LoseSparringToDaughter.GrowUpFast": "[pg]Damn but they grow up fast."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.LoseSparringToDaughter.HailOfAttacksAgain": "unable to withstand her unending hail of attacks"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.LoseSparringToDaughter.RecoverFromAssKicking": "recover from that ass kicking"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.LoseSparringToDaughter.RuffleHerHair": "[pg]You chuckle and stumble to your [feet], pausing to ruffle her hair and collect your gear."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.LoseSparringToDaughter.SentencePeriod": "."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.LoseSparringToDaughter.StraddlingPinsYou": ", and a moment later [helspawn]'s on you, straddling you with her powerful legs, pushing you down into the dirt."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.LoseSparringToDaughter.StumbleBackAgain": "As you stumble back, "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.LoseSparringToDaughter.SuccumbToLustsAgain": "succumbing to your own lusts"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.LoseSparringToDaughter.SuccumbingToYourLusts": "succumbing to your own lusts"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.LoseSparringToDaughter.SurveyingHerConquest": "[pg][say: Now, what shall I do with you, hmm?] she teases, licking her lips as she surveys her conquest. [say: Mother always said it's bad form to let someone go with just an asskicking...]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.LoseSparringToDaughter.SweepsYourLegsOut": ", [helspawn] quickly sweeps your [legs] out from under you, dropping you right on your ass. You collapse with a grunt, "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.LoseSparringToDaughter.UnableToClenchFists": "unable to even clench your fists anymore"
