  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.MaiVisitsHerKids.EnoughOfAHandful": "[pg][say: Oh, no,] Hel laughs, giving her lover a playful push, [say: this one's enough of a handful, aren't you?]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.MaiVisitsHerKids.GoldChainGift": "[pg][helspawn] lights up as Mai slips the gold chain around her daughter's neck. [say: Something to remember me by when I'm not around,] she says with a wink, letting her kid skip off to find a mirror."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.MaiVisitsHerKids.HelAsksMaiOpinion": "[pg][say: So what do you think, Mai?] Hel says, nodding down to her daughter."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.MaiVisitsHerKids.HelWavesYouOver": "[pg][say: Heyya, lover mine, look who stopped in!] Hel calls, waving you over until you slip down beside her, a warm, leathery tail quickly wrapping around your waist."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.MaiVisitsHerKids.LeansOnMaiLeg": "[pg][helspawn] happily leans her head against Mai's leg, accepting the affection with her tail swishing gaily behind her, foxy ears twitching as Mai brushes them."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.MaiVisitsHerKids.MaiDemureGreeting": "[pg][say: Hi, [name],] Mai says with a demure smile, arms wrapped around [helspawn]'s belly, trying to hold the daughter that's near [if (metric) {thirty centimeters|a foot}] taller than she is. Finally, laughing, she lets the young salamander go. [helspawn] drops down to sit beside her mother and father, and quickly has both a smooth and scaly hand stroking her hair."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.MaiVisitsHerKids.MaiKissesSalamander": "[pg][say: Yeah, we did good, Hel,] she says, leaning over to give the salamander a quick kiss. [say: She's a real beauty... and knowing you, she's going to be a hell of a fighter some day. You should bring her around to Tel'Adre some time. We could use guards like her.]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.MaiVisitsHerKids.MaiThanksYouSoftly": "[pg][say: And you, [name],] she says, turning to you, [say: Thanks for taking care of [helspawn]. I-I mean, I know I was really making her for you and Hel anyway, but still... she's a good kid, and I love her anyway. Keep her safe, alright?]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.MaiVisitsHerKids.MockSighAnotherChild": "[pg]Mai gives a mock sigh. [say: Well, we could always have another. One for you, one for me!] she says, a little more serious this time--and with a less than subtle hint of lust in her voice."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.MaiVisitsHerKids.NoticeFamilyAtFire": "As you head back into camp, you notice Hel and [helspawn] are sitting around the cook fire in the center of camp, with your daughter balanced precariously on the lap of her biological father, Mai the fox-girl."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.MaiVisitsHerKids.ParentsLaughMaiKneels": "[pg]Her parents laugh, and Mai drops down to a knee beside her, reaching into a pocket to produce a small box. [say: I know it's not much, but since I can't get out here often enough...] Mai says, opening it to produce a gold necklace adorned with a small gem clasp."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.MaiVisitsHerKids.PassesFlaskAround": "[pg][helspawn] leans back, pulling out a flask and taking a deep swill before passing it to her father, who takes it with a knowing smile and knocks it back like a champ."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.MaiVisitsHerKids.PromiseThenMaiGoes": "[pg]You promise that you will, and with a quick nod, Mai runs after [helspawn] to say goodbye for the day. As she leaves, Helia grins, holding you tight against her. [say: She's a good girl, [name]. Couldn't have picked a better sire for our girl.]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.MaiVisitsHerKids.SalamanderGuardJoke": "[pg][say: A salamander guard? That'll be the day!] Hel laughs, [say: they barely let Pop and Kiri in. No, you're gonna have to walk it if you wanna see your little girl.]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.MaiVisitsHerKids.WhinesCrossingArms": "[pg][say: Heeeeeyyyyyy,] [helspawn] whines, crossing her arms with a huff."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.MaiWouldBeTheBestInseminator.MaiLovelyFather": "You tell Hel that you think Mai would make a lovely father. Helia nods her agreement, saying, [say: Yeah, I agree. She's a beauty, and I'm sure our child will be stunning... you wouldn't mind if she visited, right? I mean, you and I will be raising our kid--and he'll be ours for sure--but I'm sure Mai will want to at least visit her kid.]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.MaiWouldBeTheBestInseminator.NodSayFineAgreement": "[pg]You nod, and say that's fine. Hel beams at you, giving you a peck on the cheek before running back to camp, saying she's going to go track down the foxy sisters as soon as she can. You suppose the next time you see her, Hel's probably going to be pregnant with the child you'll be helping to raise."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.NameDatHelspawn.ShareLaughWhileSuckling": "You and Helia share a laugh, looking down at your little girl as she suckles. After a few happy, blissful minutes though, Hel turns to you with a question:"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.NameDatHelspawn.WhatToNameHer": "[pg][say: So... what do we name her, love? I honestly hadn't put that much thought into girl names. Kind of expected a boy, I guess, but... it's up to you, [name]. What do you think?]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.NoHuntingBitches.DecideToPass": "You decide to pass, earning a shrug from the salamanders."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.NoHuntingBitches.GuestsWaveGoodbye": "Eventually, Hakon and Kiri leave, waving goodbye until the next time they can visit."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.NoHuntingBitches.HelHopesYouReconsider": "[pg][say: Well, maybe you'll change your mind next time. Plenty of evil furbags to go around!] Hel says with a laugh. [say: C'mon, let's find something for the folks to eat, huh?]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.NoHuntingBitches.SitDownForDinner": "[pg]With that settled, you sit down as Hel passes out something that must be akin to dinner for her family--mostly booze and ration--and soon you're enjoying a meal with the rowdy family, laughing at Hel's ribald jokes or Hakon's old war stories. "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.NoKidsHel.CantFitTooBig": "You couldn't if you wanted to anyway--you're too big to fit. "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.NoKidsHel.NotInterestedForNow": "[pg]You tell her that no, at least for now you aren't interested. She begs and pleads for several minutes, but you hold your ground. Finally, she relents. [say: Alright, [name]. I... I'll respect that, I guess. Dad gave me some herbs, said as long as I take them, I should go back to normal. If that's what you want, I'll start on them. Just tell me if--when--you're ready, [name]. I will be.]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.NoKidsHel.PecOnCheekLeaving": "[pg]She leans up and gives you a peck on the cheek before wandering back to camp, leaving you standing alone in the dark with your choices. Eventually, you manage to go back to sleep..."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.NoKidsHel.ShakeHeadChildRefusal": "You shake you head and say no, you don't want to have children. Not right now, anyway. "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.NoKidsHel.ShouldersSlumpCrestfallen": "As the words leave your lips, you can see Hel's shoulders slump, a crestfallen look spreading across her face. [say: A-are you sure? Please, [name], I really, really want a child. For </i>us<i> to have one.]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.NoYouDontLoveHeliaYouMonster.EnjoySexNotLove": "As much as you enjoy the sex, as much as you like Hel, you can't say you feel that way towards her. You grasp her shoulders, telling her as gently as possible how you feel. She nods slowly as you speak, rubbing at her eyes by the time you're finished."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.NoYouDontLoveHeliaYouMonster.ThanksForHonesty": "[pg][saystart]Well, thanks for being honest, [name]. I... I really do appreciate it. But, maybe you can still help me with my problem. I'll understand if not, but still, I have to ask: "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.OhGodEwKihaAndHelspawnSuckAtCooking.CleanCauldronLesson": "[pg]You promptly begin cleaning the cauldron and inform [helspawn] that you'll be showing her how it's really done."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.OhGodEwKihaAndHelspawnSuckAtCooking.CrossedFingersLie": "[pg]You tell her that of course you didn't, crossing a pair of fingers behind your back."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.OhGodEwKihaAndHelspawnSuckAtCooking.DragonessHissesTemple": "[pg][say: The fuck happened?] the dragoness hisses, rubbing her temple. [say: Feel like I got hit with a hammer.]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.OhGodEwKihaAndHelspawnSuckAtCooking.GrowlsSpoonsTaste": "[pg][say: Oh, what the fuck do you know anyway, you big ass! It's perfectly fine, isn't it [helspawn]?] she growls, spooning up a mouthful of the stuff before you can stop her. A heartbeat after she swallows, Kiha goes completely stiff; her eyes growing as wide as saucers as they water. She collapses backwards, falling onto her back with a muted <i>THUD</i>."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.OhGodEwKihaAndHelspawnSuckAtCooking.IncredulousLookSip": "[pg]Kiha gives you an incredulous look, but takes a tentative sip anyway. Her eyes brighten as she takes a second, and then a third gulp, soon shoveling it in greedily. [say: Told ya, doofus!] she gloats, putting down the empty bowl. [say: Nothing beats aunt Kiha's special recipe!]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.OhGodEwKihaAndHelspawnSuckAtCooking.KihaSnatchesBowl": "[pg][say: Hmm?] Kiha says, snatching the bowl. [say: You didn't muck with this, did you doofus?] she asks, giving you an accusing glance."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.OhGodEwKihaAndHelspawnSuckAtCooking.LieAboutFall": "[pg][say: You, uh, fell off the edge, aunt Kiha. And spilled all the stew. Here, we remade it for you!] [helspawn] lies, presenting \"aunt Kiha\" with a bowl full of an aromatic brown goop, full of carrots and spices floating atop it like boats on a placid lake. At least it smells better."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.OhGodEwKihaAndHelspawnSuckAtCooking.ShakeHeadEatLunch": "[pg]You just shake your head and grab a bowl, sitting down with the scaly ladies as you enjoy your lunch, trying to ignore the little shit-eating grin [helspawn]'s sporting all the while."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.OhGodEwKihaAndHelspawnSuckAtCooking.SpecialSpiceBlend": "[pg]You and [helspawn] are soon working away, stirring up your own special blend of your rations and the spices she and Kiha gathered for the first attempt. Once you've got the basics in, you step back and hand the ladle over, telling the young 'mander to go wild. Grinning like a kid, she goes to work, mixing in a wild combination of ingredients. The cauldron's full to bursting by the time she's done, and no sooner does she ladle out the first bowl of it than Kiha sits up, groaning."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.OhGodEwKihaAndHelspawnSuckAtCooking.SpewStewGround": "You spew the stew onto the ground and grab a nearby waterskin, trying to flush the taste from your mouth. Kiha and [helspawn] look on with horror as you wipe your mouth and begin to try and coherently explain just how god awful whatever that... STUFF... you just put in your mouth was. Shock turns to anger before you're halfway through admonishing the pair of scaly redheads. Kiha scowls at you and snatches the ladle from you."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.OhGodEwKihaAndHelspawnSuckAtCooking.UnconsciousDumpCauldron": "[pg]Looking down at the clearly unconscious dragoness, you pick up the cauldron and dump it out onto the parched earth, watching the wasteland swallow the abominable concoction up--though even it seems hesitant to consume Kiha's cooking, as the cracks in the ground fill with the musky liquid, only slowly draining away into the dirt."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.OhGodEwKihaAndHelspawnSuckAtCooking.YelpsAtCollapse": "[pg][say: K-Kiha?] [helspawn] yelps, watching the dragoness collapse into a pile of limp scales and leather. [say: Are you okay? Is she okay, {0}?]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.PlayWithYourKid.HelGladlyHandsOver": "[pg][say: Sure, that'd be great! I'd love it if you could take her off my hands for a sec.] She glances down at the little salamander, who is currently poking at something you can't quite see with a stick. [say: She really is a handful...]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.PlayWithYourKid.HeliaExplainsToChild": "[pg]Helia leans down and explains the situation to your daughter, who proceeds to eagerly run up to you, her smile brimming with energy. How do you plan to pass the time?"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.PlayWithYourKid.OfferToWatchDaughter": "You tell Hel that you'd like to spend some quality time with [helspawn], and she immediately brightens up."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.PostSexHelspawn.BreathlessGropingKiss": "After a few breathless moments of mutual groping you are the one to break the kiss but only so that you may kiss her elsewhere. With a grin she leans back, her perky breasts shining with sweat as you bury your face in her neck. You hear her squeal as you lay her back against the mess of ejaculants the two of you have made together.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.PostSexHelspawn.CumStrewnGearRecover": "Returning to the cum strewn site of your recent coitus you find your {0} and pull it on. Your duty as champion beckons. With your [armor] on and your [weapon] in hand you give [helspawn]'s sleeping brow a quick kiss and rise, leaving her to doze peacefully.[pg]"
