  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.PostSexHelspawn.GazingSoftExtricate": "After a few moments of gazing at her beautiful face you softy extricate yourself from her sleeping arms. She releases a soft moan and rolls over once you've freed yourself. Taking her into your arms you carry [helspawn] over to your bedroll and place her within its folds. She opens her eyes and gives you a smile before closing them again.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.PostSexHelspawn.GigglingPushAway": "She pushes you away with a giggle, saying, [say: Stop it, [Daddy].][pg]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.PostSexHelspawn.GroaningWarmEmbrace": "She groans as you share your meal, eagerly pulling you against her and enveloping you in her warmth. She seems to enjoy the taste as much as you do and sucks every drop from your tongue before following through and giving you one last long, hard kiss.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.PostSexHelspawn.KissTrailHeatedBody": "Using your lips you create a trail of soft kisses, each a wet proclamation of love, down her heated body. You begin with her flawless neck, tickling her as you create soft brown marks that stand out against her pale skin. Then you head down to her pert nipples, twirling your [tongue] around each hard stud that serves as a gentle reminder that she is still aroused. You taste her sweat covered form, kissing her trim belly and her soft thighs. You suckle, lick and kiss her legs and thighs until you pull her knees apart, exposing her cum glazed vagina.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.PostSexHelspawn.LoveYouDriftOff": "[say: I love you, [Daddy],] your darling [helspawn] says as she begins to drift off.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.PostSexHelspawn.MarathonBreathRecovery": "You both collapse on the ground, breathing like you've just run a marathon. "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.PostSexHelspawn.NoddingSlurpFinish": "Nodding, you acquiesce to her request and finish by slurping the insanely tasty mixture from her pussy. The taste is mind blowing and you can't help but swirl the potent mixture around in your mouth. Then you notice [helspawn] noticing you with an amused grin as if she's about to make a joke at your expense. So, to shut her up before she even has a chance to speak, you kiss her.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.PostSexHelspawn.SlickSweatCollapse": "Both slick with sweat, cum and lady juices, the two of you collapse on the ground, ignoring the fact that you're lying in a pool of each other's fluids. You're both breathing as though you've just run a marathon. "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.PostSexHelspawn.SmirkFeignedQuestion": "You smile and ask her if you're doing it wrong, you of course know you're not.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.PostSexHelspawn.SoftDozeSilence": "The two of you doze softly for a few moments, enjoying each other's company in silence. As she snuggles against your chest you reflect on all the things that brought the two of you together. You recall how Helia woke you up in the middle of the night. You look down at [helspawn]'s softly sleeping form and know that there are no regrets to be had concerning the beautiful little girl who calls you \"[Daddy]\".[pg]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.PostSexHelspawn.StomachGrowlFeast": "Your stomach growls, the meal before you making you hunger, so you dive in. You taste your own masculine seed sweetened with her lady cum. The heavenly combination is a gourmet taste sensation you can't help but love having on your [tongue]. She squeals again as your tongue slides against her vaginal lips and shining clitoris.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.PostSexHelspawn.TenderBellyRub": "[say: I'm all tender,] she says as she rubs her belly shyly. [say: It's too sensitive.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.PostSexHelspawn.TiredYawnSnuggle": "Starting to feel tired the two of you fall back with a yawn. [helspawn] snuggles against you, placing her head on your [chest].[pg]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.PostSexHelspawn.TwinkleGrinSmile": "You look up into her face with a grin and she smiles down at you with a twinkle in her eye. She spreads her legs as her tail presses her body into the air, presenting you with her cum soaked vaginal opening. You just enjoy the sight for a moment, watching as pearly liquid drips down her body to join the cum beneath the two of you.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.PostSexHelspawn.YawningForeheadKiss": "With a yawn you kiss her forehead and tell her you love her as well.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.ScoldHelSpawn.ConfusedStammer": "[pg][say: Wha...]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.ScoldHelSpawn.CrossArmsDemand": "You cross your arms over your chest and ask your little salamander exactly what she thinks she's doing."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.ScoldHelSpawn.CurlBesideYou": "[pg][say: Alright, {0},] [helspawn] says, curling up beside you, head resting on your [chest]."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.ScoldHelSpawn.DrinkExcuseLine": "[pg][say: I was, uh, just havin' a drink. Mom drank twice as much as I must've 'fore she left...]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.ScoldHelSpawn.OfferWaterskin": "[pg]You sit down beside [helspawn] and grab a waterskin, telling her to drink some of this instead--it'll curb the hangover later. With a look from you, she meekly obeys, sipping at the waterskin as you start to explain that there's no good to come from being a drunkard: that it impairs her decision making, and clouds her mind; like she is now, barely able to think straight after downing gallons. She's lucky she doesn't die from drinking that much, especially without the tolerances her mother's probably spent years building up."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.ScoldHelSpawn.PickUpByScruff": "[pg][say: Uh, I'm... uh...] she starts before you pick her up by the scruff of the neck, pulling her away from the still. She squirms and flails drunkenly in your grasp, but is unable to escape in her condition. [say: P-put me down, {0}!] she squeals, but you only tsk your tongue as you drag her away, dropping her on your bedroll, well away from the booze."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.ScoldHelSpawn.RebutMotherExample": "[pg]And just because her mother does something means she should, too?"
