  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.Snipermanders.AlchemistRuckusGlass": " You hear your old alchemist friend suddenly putting up a ruckus as the sounds of breaking glass echo throughout camp. [helspawn] looks up at you nervously, but you ruffle her fiery hair and tell her to try again. Rath is probably just fine."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.Snipermanders.ArrowStrikesTrue": "[pg]Again, [helspawn] lets an arrow fly--and this one strikes true. You watch the missile streak across camp, slamming into the training dummy's crotch with deadly force. It sways, buckles, and falls to pieces."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.Snipermanders.CorrectsGripHaft": ", and you find yourself having to correct her grip on the haft several times. But, finally, you get her ready to shoot."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.Snipermanders.DrawsBowstringAiming": "[pg]Breathing hard, the young salamander draws back the bowstring, lining up on her target. She chews on her lower lip, eyes squinting, deep in concentration, wanting to make this first shot count--to make you proud. She looses the arrow, and gasps as it bolts away with lethal force... and sails across camp, well away from the target."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.Snipermanders.EncourageSecondTry": "[pg]You sigh and tell her to try again. She can't expect to be perfect on the first try, after all. It takes a little convincing, but soon you've got [helspawn] back into form and nocking an arrow. You put your hands on hers, helping the young salamander take aim, drawing down on her straw-stuffed target. Barely audible over [helspawn]'s nervous breathing, you whisper, [say: Take it easy. Relax... Good. Take aim... now breathe out. Exhale and loose.]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.Snipermanders.EvenLizardLegs": ", even with your own lizard legs"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.Snipermanders.GenericYelpAngry": " You hear a sudden yelp of pain from across camp. [latexyname] slithers up to you with an irritated look on her gooey face, pointing an accusing finger at an arrow sticking out of her tit. [say: Dammit, [name], I'm a googirl, not a pin cushion!] You wave her off, and tell [helspawn] to try again."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.Snipermanders.HelTakesBreak": "You tell Hel to take a break: you've got this handled. Grabbing your bow and quiver from over your shoulder, you hand them over to your eager daughter. [helspawn] takes them up with surprising reverence, holding them as gingerly as glass. Grinning, you clasp her shoulder and tell her how to put the quiver on, and get her stance right for shooting. It takes her a moment to get set up{0}"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.Snipermanders.LaughsSippingFlask": "[pg][say: Ouch,] Hel laughs, sipping on her flask behind you. [say: What'd that poor dummy ever do to you?]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.Snipermanders.PumpsFistTriumph": "[pg][say: I did it!] [helspawn] shouts, pumping her fist in the air. Her mother reaches over to ruffle her fiery hair, and you both shower her with congratulations."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.Snipermanders.SecondLessonKiddo": "[pg]Before she can get cocky, though, you push the bow back into her hands. [say: Lesson 2, kiddo: one shot is never enough.]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.Snipermanders.SlipBehindGuideArms": "[pg]You slip behind [helspawn], putting your arms on hers as you guide her through nocking an arrow, head resting on her fist, a lone finger outstretched toward the desiccated dummy."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.Snipermanders.StanceDummyReset": "[pg]By the time [helspawn] has her shooting stance back, her mother's already set the dummy back up, ready for round two. It's several hours long before the three of you quit: time spent drilling [helspawn] on stance and aim, even going a round with her and a pair of daggers to remind her that enemies will eventually close in if she's not careful. She learns quickly, though, and soon she hardly needs your help to plant an arrow in the target's chest."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.Snipermanders.ValeriaYelpIrritated": " You hear a sudden yelp of pain from across camp. Valeria slithers up to you with an irritated look on her gooey face, pointing an accusing finger at an arrow sticking out of her tit. [say: Dammit, [name], I'm a googirl, not a pin cushion!] You wave her off, and tell [helspawn] to try again."
