  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.SwordAndBoardmander.BracesBreathAttack": "[pg]Your daughter braces herself, drawing a breath just a second before she launches her attack, giving herself away. You parry three quick blows, stepping back as [helspawn] leaps into another overhand strike. You dodge, spinning out of the attack and slicing her right across her bare belly."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.SwordAndBoardmander.CautiousApproachBlade": "[pg][helspawn] picks herself up and grips her blade. This time she's a little more cautious, approaching slowly, pausing just out of reach. You hide a grin and bring your own sword up, the tips of your blades nearly touching. You tell her that she's on the right track--there's no need to be reckless, and charging right in at the first opportunity is likely to get her killed."
