  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.SwordAndBoardmander.ResumeSparringStance": "[pg]You tell her to go again, assuming your fighting stance."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.SwordAndBoardmander.RuffleComfortFeet": "[pg]You pull [helspawn] to her feet and ruffle her hair. You comfort her and tell her not to give up, grabbing a dinner plate and some leather straps from your kit. In a moment, you've got a rudimentary shield cobbled together. You fit it over the young salamander's free arm and give her a few pointers on stance. Nervously, she brings her makeshift shield to bear against you, fidgeting under the heft of it as you make a few slow, easy to parry swings for her to get used to it. Steadily you pick up the pace, swinging your training sword faster and harder, forcing [helspawn] to parry and block, retreating against your onslaught. You keep it up for a full minute before relenting, letting the kid seize the initiative. She swings at you, rolling with each parry you make, cleaving into another swing, turning your ripostes aside with her shield and forcing you back."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.SwordAndBoardmander.SidelinesCheerMug": "[pg][say: Get {0}, [helspawn]!] Hel calls from the sidelines, sipping on a mug. [say: Show [him] what a salamander can do!]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.SwordAndBoardmander.StumblesToKnees": "[pg][say: Gah!] she cries, stumbling to her knees. [say: I-I can't...]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.AcceptGuitarInvite": "[pg]You can't say no to that, and absently wonder how she plays a guitar with those giant claws of hers as she leads you back to her and Helia's part of camp, where she quickly produces a dinged up guitar. Looks like Hel's been visiting the pawn shop, but hey, [helspawn] doesn't seem to mind. She hops up onto a nearby rock and gives the instrument a few experimental strums, pausing to adjust the tuning or fix a string that snaps a little too easily. But after a moment of preparation, she's ready."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.AdultInYourCustoms": "[pg][say: E-eh? I'm an adult, [dad],{0}] she replies. Where you're from, nobody is an adult until more than a decade of their life, or even two decades! It doesn't matter how old she feels, she is <i>still</i> a child to you, and you <i>will</i> bond with her!"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.AmilySolutionMakeshift": "Little Amily's solution was makeshift at best, and the children are beyond my reach to study. Still. "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.AwkwardApologySmile": "[pg]Your daughter smiles awkwardly. [say: Sorry for bringing my friend home uninvited. I just... didn't want to upset you. I love you, [dad],] she says, resting her head on [if (height < 75) {yours|your shoulder}] and slipping her tail around you. You reciprocate the sentiment and hold the young 'mander close. [if (!helspawnchaste) {Even if she wants to be just like [if (isfeminine) {Helia|mom}], she shouldn't start fucking everything that moves. Many of the monsters out there are dangerous, and she is not the warrior either of her parents are yet.|She should know better than to bring monsters out of the wilderness for a quick fuck. She's not [if (isfeminine) {Helia|her mother}], lust doesn't have to dominate her life.}]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.AwkwardLeanOn": "[pg]Admittedly, this is a very awkward position for you. Nevertheless, you lean on the fiery warrior as she marches on."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.CheckingHerGrowth": "[pg][saystart]Just checking up on her, [name]. Her meteoric growth is of some concern--and scientific interest, I might add, if I could determine what caused it. If I could mass-produce it. "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.ComeSeeMyWork": "[say: Oh hey, {0}! You gotta come see what I was making!]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.DaughterGroans": "[pg]Your daughter groans, [say: This just got so much dumber.]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.DaughterPrattles": "[pg]Your salamander daughter prattles on, though her face suggests she is picking up on your shift in expression. Whatever Shouldra wants to suggest is already distracting, but you humor her and hear her out."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.DoubtSheWouldHave": "[pg]You doubt she would have; [bathgirlname] seems to have a fancy for you, but"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.DragonessLaughsFoot": "[pg][say: And it'll be YOUR favorite too, mini-doofus, just you wait,] the dragoness laughs, her foot making another slow, steady circuit around the pot, stirring the ingredients. Grinning at you, Kiha lifts her ladle up, letting you take it from between her toes. The powerful reek of whatever it is they're trying to cook almost overwhelms you when you bring it up to your lips, nearly staggering you. By Marae, what did Kiha <i>put</i> in this? Raw ass?"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.FinalChorusDuet": ". You smile as Isabella seats herself beside [helspawn], joining their voices together for the final chorus that leaves them both shaking as [helspawn] strums the last, desperate notes, nearly clawing through the strings in her passion."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.FinishedGrowingNoSign": "[pg][say: But I suppose that's still out of reach, [name]. She's finished growing, and there's no sign of the exact chemical needed to synthesize the compound. I'll keep checking up on her for health, though perhaps one day I'll find the means to make accelerated growth safe and widespread. An old man can hope, yes?]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.FollowToLaboratory": "[pg]Chuckling, you nod and follow [helspawn] as she returns to Rath's makeshift laboratory and seats herself on one of his tables. Grumbling about kids, the old rat proceeds to rap his little hammer on her knee--nearly getting kicked in the face for his trouble--before asking her to hold her breath as he listens to her heartbeat. She's nearly blue in the face before he nods approvingly and tells her she can go. [helspawn] goes running, happy to get away as Rath turns to you, shaking his head."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.GermanSehrGut": "Sehr gut"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.GrabByArmorPull": "[pg]She grabs you by the [armor], pulling you back toward where she had been standing, near the center of camp. A large cast-iron cauldron's sitting on your firepit, full of a dark-green substance that's bubbling along. Your dusky dragoness lover, Kiha, is sitting on the edge of the pot, apparently immune to the scalding heat, a long wooden ladle grasped between her dexterous claws. She grins up at you as you and your daughter wander over. [say: Hey, Doofus, come for an early taste?]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.HeliaJoinsRide": "[pg]Helia, grinning ear-to-ear, says, [say: Hell no! I'm joining you.] As the berserker hops aboard behind your other passenger, your daughter sighs and winces. Once settled in, Helia declares, [say: Onward, mighty steed! The family rides into battle!]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.HeliaLaughsSees": "[pg]Helia laughs as she sees the two of you [walking] up. [say: Wow, having fun there?]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.HeliaNeverTooBig": "[pg]Helia, grinning ear-to-ear, says, [say: You're never too big for a piggy-back ride, [helspawn]! In fact, neither of you are!] The salamander turns around and grabs you, lifting you and [helspawn] up at once. Never doubt a berserker's strength, it would seem."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.IsabellaBigHug": " little [helspawn],[sayend] Isabella says, pulling the young 'mander into a great big hug that threatens to smother her betwixt the cow-girl's massive bosoms. Grinning, you congratulate [helspawn] on her performance, showering your girl in praise before you depart, leaving her to Isabella's instruction. As you walk away, you can't help but notice Helia standing a short ways off, rubbing her eyes."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.IsabellaJoinsSong": "[pg]You open an eye as Isabella approaches, belting out a misty-eyed verse in her strange language, and you can practically feel her homesickness, her separation from a lifetime of friends and loved ones. As her arms cross under her enormous breasts, you can't help but think of the mutations she has undergone"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.IsabellaSongOpening": "[pg][saystart]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.JustAWobbleRide": "[pg]You tell her it'd be more of a wobble, but"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.JustTrustMeIronic": "[pg]\"Just trust me\" ironically makes it harder to trust her."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.LearnAboutSpiderBoy": "[pg]Perhaps you could learn more about this spider boy of hers. He actually had a name, and seemed to be fairly civil[if (allowchild) { for a kid}]. Lucky break for her. Then again, you could tell her to just save herself and stop trying to fuck things altogether. "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.LegionsOfChildren": "Imagine whole legions of children reared and raised in the time it takes a goblin to do the same. We might have a fighting chance for once, with numbers to match the demons.[sayend]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.LoverSmilesApproach": "[pg]When you approach, your lover smiles at you, saying, [say: I always wanted to be a bard when I was a little girl. I'm... I'm glad [helspawn]'s getting the chance, at least.]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.MilkHerLaterGrin": "[pg][say: Aww,] [helspawn] grins, looking down at the napping [bathgirlname]. [say: Guess I can milk her later, then.]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.MomTellDadAdult": "[pg][say: Moooom, tell [dad] I'm an adult, [he] says [he] won't accept it,] [helspawn] whines."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.NewGuitarInvite": "[say: Oh hey, {0}!] [helspawn] says, suddenly grinning, [say: Mom bought me a new guitar in town. Wanna come listen?]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.NonsenseIsNormal": "[pg]She speaks nonsense, this <i>is</i> normal. Just because she's [if (metric) {{almost two meters|over six feet}}] tall and toned doesn't mean she gets exempt from piggy-back rides. You carry [helspawn] off around the camp as she buries her face in her hands, smiling and giggling, until she calms down. Soon, you spot her {0}mom."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.PiggybackIgnore": "[pg]Ignoring her protests, you turn around and back up, lifting her onto your back. [say: [Dad]! This is ridiculous!] your daughter exclaims, though laughing all throughout. [say: You don't <b>need</b> to do this, I'm happy bonding with you like a normal person.]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.ProperGallop": "[pg]This time, you pick up into a proper gallop, showing the salamanders your true power. To keep from falling off, [helspawn] grabs your torso and holds on tight, with Helia hugging her as well for the simple fun of it."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.QuietMomentChat": "Unfortunately, there doesn't seem to be anything in particular to talk about at the moment. The two of you spend the time in companionable quiet, making smalltalk."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.RaggedVoiceScolds": "[say: [helspawn]!] you hear a ragged old voice call, [say: Get back here this instant! I'm not done with you yet!]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.RathazulShufflesIn": "[pg][say: Coming!] [helspawn] calls back as Rathazul shuffles into view, waving around what looks like a tiny hammer. Whispering, [helspawn] says, [say: Could you come with me, {0}? Rathazul weirds me out.]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.ReminisceIgnamDays": "While reminiscing about your days days in Ingnam, you remember the times a parent would pick their child up on their back and how they'd laugh and bond. You offer [helspawn] a piggy-back ride."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.SeenBathGirlAnywhere": "[say: Hey, have you seen [bathgirlname] around anywhere, {0}?] [helspawn] asks, looking around the camp. [say: Mom asked me to milk her, but I haven't seen her around. She wouldn't have run off, would she?]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.ShouldraDeclaration": "[pg][say: Champ, I've got it!] Shouldra declares. You can't say you know what she's referring to, however. [say: A brilliant prank, that's what!]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.SitDownSeriousTalk": "You sit down with [helspawn], telling her you need to talk; specifically, of her nocturnal misadventures. She gulps and shifts in place,{0} but you ease her tension with a comforting hand and reassuring word. [Helspawn] is a grown woman, frightening though it may be for her and [if (isfeminine) {{Helia|her mother}}]--to say nothing of the thoughts [i:you] have about it yourself. Nevertheless, she's as physically capable and sexually charged as an adult, without nearly the life experience as [if (isunderage) {{even }}]you. Worry is warranted."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.SoftMelodicTune": "[pg]A soft, melodic tune starts to play as [helspawn]'s dexterous fingers dance across the fret, plucking at the strings with some small hesitation. She's a beginner, but not bad at all; the simple tune is sweet and she plays it with burgeoning proficiency, slowly settling into the rhythm of the piece until you can close your eyes and relax, letting her playing sooth you, carrying your troubles far away. You barely notice when a high, soft voice adds itself to the guitar, a lilting, haunting soprano that slowly grows in power as the young 'mander's playing intensifies, building toward crescendo. She's singing, surely, but the words are alien and unknowable; you think, for a moment, that perhaps they're in Helia's native tongue, but when a second voice, powerful and operatic, joins [helspawn]'s, you know who's been teaching her."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.SparTalkWithHelia": "The well-built reptilian fires off excitedly about how well her last spar with Helia went, meanwhile a nagging in the back of your mind interrupts your attempt at conversation. Unbeknownst to [helspawn], you can hear a certain spectral resident speaking to you."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.SparringChallengeTaunt": "[pg][say: We'll show this chick a real sparring challenge, just trust me. Fight her!]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.ThinkBeforeApproach": "[pg]You've had time to think about this before approaching her. Of all the things she could have brought home, that spider was [if (cor > 33) {rather cute|[if (allowchild) {just a little boy|relatively non-threatening from the looks of it}]}], it may be a healthy enough first dip into dating. [if (cor > 66) {And should the mood strike you, you'd thank yourself for having the girlish boy at hand to play with. }]On the other hand, she's barely experienced the world, it may be healthiest to stop this for now. [if (!helspawnvirgin or cor > 66 or lust+libido>75) {Needless to say|The world as it is}], you're the safest option to provide for her sexual needs, of course..."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.TryItAuntRecipe": "[pg][say: C'mon, {0}, try it!] [helspawn] adds happily. [say: It's aunt Kiha's favorite recipe.]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.VeryGoodLine": "Very good"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.WouldntHurtToCheck": " it wouldn't hurt to check around. She does tend to wander into the traps around camp from time to time. Offering [helspawn] your hand, you start searching the camp for your missing milk maid. The two of you make a circuit around camp, checking the traps and behind various rocks and hollows, to no avail. Finally, as you're starting to get worried about the dusky maid, you happen to look into the steel pool in her part of camp. Sure enough, you spy [bathgirlname] curled up at the bottom of the pool, cuddled up with a ragged blanket to catch a quick nap."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawn.YouSufferedToo": " and you yourself have suffered as well"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.TalkToHelspawnJustTalk.IgnoreGhostFocusHer": "[pg][helspawn] doesn't deserve to be subjected to Shouldra's shenanigans. You ignore the ghost and focus on the conversation, enjoying the passionate embrace that your daughter has for combat before, eventually, resuming your [day]."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.UmYum.FinishedBowlSet": "You set the finished bowl down and "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.UmYum.GrowlingStomachEat": "[pg]Cringing, you are about to set the offered bowl back down but you are reminded by your growling stomach. You have no choice but to cover your nose and just gulp down the contents of the stew. "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.UmYum.MaybeShouldCook": "[pg]Maybe you ought to start doing the cooking around here..."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.UmYum.NauseousStew": "[pg]You feel a bit nauseous. That stew surely is strange."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.UmYum.RushBehindBushes": "[pg]Gasp! You feel like you're going to throw up. You get up and rush behind the bushes. You suddenly bend over and spew the contents of your stomach from your mouth onto the ground. It takes a while but you eventually recover and you get up. "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.UmYum.SetBowlPolitely": "[pg]Cringing, you set the offered bowl back down, squeaking out that it's delicious, thank you very much, but you have something to take care of right now; maybe you can have more later. Kiha rolls her eyes and shoos you off before she and [helspawn] spoon out their lunch."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.UmYum.TellTaleGroans": "you hear the tell-tale groans and gagging of a pair of scaly ladies who've just realized what kind of abomination they've created."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.UmYum.UmYumReply": "Um, yum?"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.UmYum.WanderOffToHurl": "[pg]As you're wandering off looking for somewhere to hurl, "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.YesHeliaILoveYourButtHoleReaming.NuzzlingCheekQuestion": "[pg][say: Wh-why didn't you tell me before, anyway?] she asks, nuzzling her cheek into your [chest]. [say: Could have saved me all this trouble.]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.YesHeliaILoveYourButtHoleReaming.ShrugNeverHadChance": "[pg]You shrug, saying that you never really felt like you had the chance until now... and it's a lot cuter when she bumbles through a confession. Helia gives you a gentle punch on the shoulder, but softens the blow with another series of kisses along your [chest] and neck, holding you close as the two of you revel in the newly-revealed love you share. After a few minutes, though, Hel steps back and says, [saystart]I love you, [name], with all my heart. You're the person I want to spend the rest of my life with, if you'll have me. But I still have to tell you what's wrong. The reason I brought this all up: "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.YesHeliaILoveYourButtHoleReaming.SmilingAcceptance": "Smiling, you tell her yes. The salamander cries out with joy, jumping into your arms and kissing you, squeezing you so tightly that you feel like you're about to black out by the time she breaks the kiss, stepping back with chest heaving."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.YouWantABoy.LadyKillerSon": " And any son of mine is going to be a real lady killer, mark my words. We're going to have to fight off whole hordes of goblin sluts, all looking for a piece of our handsome little boy before you know it.[sayend]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.YouWantABoy.MissesBoysBackHome": "Would be nice to have a man around here, you know? I miss hanging around the boys back home, watching 'em strut like peacocks for every passing girl."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.YouWantABoy.QuietLaughWithLover": "[pg]You share a quiet laugh with your lover before leaving her with a kiss and a final pat on the belly--and feeling the little kick of your spawn reacting to you."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.YouWantABoy.SheCanSeeIt": "[saystart]Is that so? Yeah, I can see it. "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.YouWantABoy.WantsStrongSon": "If I were a guy, I'd want a big strong son to hang out with, too. Take him fishing, teach him how to fight the way you do... you'll make a great dad, my love. I'm sure you will."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.YouWantAGirl.DaughterRealBeauty": " Any daughter of ours is going to be a real beauty, mark my words. She'll make a succubus look like a toad before she's out of swaddling.[sayend]"
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.YouWantAGirl.GaggleOfGirls": "We're going to be a gaggle of tittering girls before you know it, though. Salamanders grow up so fast, [name]... I just hope she doesn't turn out like me, you know? I don't know if I could stomach seeing my little girl becoming a wanton slut like her mom. I might get jealous, after all..."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.YouWantAGirl.GirlWouldBeGreat": "[saystart]Yeah, a girl would be pretty great. "
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.YouWantAGirl.QuietLaughWithLover": "[pg]You share a quiet laugh with your lover before leaving her with a kiss and a final pat on the belly--and feeling the little kick of your spawn reacting to you."
  "Scenes.Helspawnscene.YouWantAGirl.WarnsAboutGirls": "I dunno if you had any sisters growing up, [name], but let me warn you: a little girl, especially a little salamandress, is going to be a hell of a handful. But I can just see you when she's all grown up, packing a big old sword and threatening every boy that wants a piece of her: 'Treat her right or you'll have the CHAMPION to deal with. Rawr.'"
}
